WEBVTT

1
00:00:13,100 --> 00:00:15,370
Zhou Ting, what do you want to do?

2
00:00:15,570 --> 00:00:17,090
You, you didn't sleep

3
00:00:17,490 --> 00:00:26,030
What’s wrong, Sister Weiwei?

4
00:00:26,190 --> 00:00:27,230
I saw it with my own eyes

5
00:00:27,550 --> 00:00:29,150
Zhao Ya and Shen Xiaotang hid food secretly

6
00:00:29,270 --> 00:00:30,310
Just hide it in that bag

7
00:00:30,430 --> 00:00:31,630
Which eye did you see?

8
00:00:31,830 --> 00:00:34,110
I've been watching you for several nights and you went out in the middle of the night.

9
00:00:34,230 --> 00:00:36,340
Just hide and eat when you get back.

10
00:00:36,460 --> 00:00:39,540
After searching, it will become clear. Shen Xiaotang brought the bag over.

11
00:00:39,940 --> 00:00:41,710
This is my personal belongings

12
00:00:41,870 --> 00:00:45,230
Why don't you spread my bag and don't dare to let people see it? It's because you have something wrong with you.

13
00:00:45,630 --> 00:00:47,190
If you want to search, search yours first

14
00:00:47,940 --> 00:00:49,660
Zhou Ting, do you dare?

15
00:00:50,140 --> 00:00:53,290
Me I am the innocent Zhao Ya

16
00:00:53,990 --> 00:00:55,590
Are you confused about the big and small kings?

17
00:00:56,380 --> 00:00:58,020
Zhou Ting, bring the bag
